1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
Push the trunk button...

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:03,000
and nothing happens.

3
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,600
Check the fuse first —

4
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:09,000
a blown trunk-release fuse is the most common cause.

5
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,000
Fuse fine?

6
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:17,000
Look for a manual release — a pull tab or cable loop inside the trunk itself.

7
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:19,500
Still stuck?

8
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:23,000
The release solenoid or its cable may just be worn out.

9
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:25,000
We can trace it down.

10
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:27,000
Nick's Tire and Auto — link in bio.
